# Mirror CI's "i18n catalog + manifest" gate so a missing key or a stale
# manifest.json never reaches a push (and a red CI run). Both checks are
# sub-second and need no build. See grimoire/CLAUDE.md for the i18n workflow.
pnpm i18n:check
node scripts/gen-locale-manifest.mjs --check

# Mojibake guard. v1.26.1 shipped 77 cp1252-round-tripped sequences because the
# corruption is invisible in review and the fix happened to sit uncommitted in
# the working tree. This is the cheapest place to catch a recurrence.
pnpm encoding:check
